{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.poster.avif?t=1756908491\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.webm?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.mp4?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE PROTOCOL: DEMO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op survival horror game, you wake up inside a structure where physical reality has collapsed.<br>Corridors opening into abysses, twisted architectures, and unidentified entities drag you into a struggle for both sanity and survival.<br>Communicate, solve puzzles, expose the saboteur, and find a way out of this decaying universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/ca0581a37d8e0460c63fecf546fb9565.avif?t=1756908491\" data-has-big width=1560 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.poster.avif?t=1756908491\" width=780 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.webm?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.mp4?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The map reshapes itself in every playthrough!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is shattering, universes are colliding. You and your team must survive and find an escape route in this twisted structure, which reshapes differently each time and is filled with traps and supernatural entities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.poster.avif?t=1756908491\" width=780 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.webm?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.mp4?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unknown Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This universe is roamed by unknown entities drawn from different dimensions and realities. They respond to sounds, movements, and environmental interactions.<br>Your mission is to survive these dangers and remain as silent as possible. Because some things awaken only to sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/86db4f085b4da42538dcfc693d44b50c.avif?t=1756908491\" data-has-big width=1560 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.poster.avif?t=1756908491\" width=780 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.webm?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.mp4?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles Change with Every Playthrough!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles arranged differently each time require careful exploration and cooperation.<br>Use your intelligence to progress through locked doors, trapped mechanisms, and environmental clues.<br>Every solved puzzle brings you one step closer to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/25b5943dc2f441ac78662becc23b2658.avif?t=1756908491\" data-has-big width=1560 height=346 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/1ad12ce7cb2b03c3d843710f0a1ffb8d.poster.avif?t=1756908491\" width=780 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/1ad12ce7cb2b03c3d843710f0a1ffb8d.webm?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/1ad12ce7cb2b03c3d843710f0a1ffb8d.mp4?t=1756908491\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Last Soldier Standing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am developing this game solo and constantly improving it.<br>If you are patient and supportive, I will be very grateful.<br>Your feedback is also very valuable to me. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/extras/155b42d2c4717e9a3e79483b2f1d963a.avif?t=1756908491\" data-has-big width=1560 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Our Discord Community</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us to stay updated on game developments, meet other players, and plan escape strategies.<br>Your feedback directly contributes to the development of the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864850?t=1756908491","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3864850?t=1756908491","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/e099fe66bb43fac5e0b6d0064fdb7fc3265900e3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756908491","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864850/e099fe66bb43fac5e0b6d0064fdb7fc3265900e3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756908491","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game may not be suitable for all players.\r\n\r\nEscape Protocol: Online is filled with intense horror elements, disturbing images, violent scenes, and graphic depictions of blood. Players may encounter dismemberment, terrifying creatures, and sudden death scenes during gameplay. The game offers a horror experience themed around survival in a hostile supernatural environment.\r\n\r\nThe game does not contain sexual cont